  "name": "llm-memory",
  "description": "This repository contains the results of all experiments (inlcuding every single hyperparameter run) reported in the following paper:\nOrhan AE (2023) Recognition, recall, and retention of few-shot memories in large language models. arXiv:2303.17557.\nA brief description of the directories included in this repository:\n\nevals: contains the results of all recognition experiments\nrecalls: contains the results of all recall experiments\nre-evals: contains the results of all recognition experiments\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/eminorhan/llm-memory.",
